{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 103,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.4098510742188,
        96.65460968017578
      ],
      "text": "community mobilization of resources for cost-effective comprehensive and  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        97.58612060546875,
        180.9678955078125,
        110.9376220703125
      ],
      "text": "holistic care;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        117.05743408203125,
        473.4590148925781,
        130.52394104003906
      ],
      "text": "provision of education, supervision and support for staff and volunteers. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        140.3873291015625,
        328.4473571777344,
        157.11532592773438
      ],
      "text": "The child as the “index” case of TB or HIV",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        164.1268310546875,
        513.5065307617188,
        177.47833251953125
      ],
      "text": "When a child is diagnosed with TB, it is common to find others in the family with TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        180.12335205078125,
        513.4259643554688,
        193.474853515625
      ],
      "text": "who may also need further assessment. When a child is diagnosed as HIV-positive, the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        196.119873046875,
        513.4834594726562,
        209.47137451171875
      ],
      "text": "mother will almost certainly also be HIV-positive, the father probably and other siblings",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        212.11639404296875,
        513.3800659179688,
        225.4678955078125
      ],
      "text": "possibly. Assessment for TB (and HIV) should be recommended to parents and siblings",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        228.1129150390625,
        247.79893493652344,
        241.46441650390625
      ],
      "text": "of children with TB (and TB/HIV).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        254.29119873046875,
        209.71939086914062,
        271.0191955566406
      ],
      "text": "Support for the family",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        278.03070068359375,
        513.4029541015625,
        291.3822021484375
      ],
      "text": "The health care worker needs to determine how much care can be expected from family",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        294.0272216796875,
        513.4261474609375,
        307.37872314453125
      ],
      "text": "members and what must be obtained from other sources. This requires the following",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        310.02374267578125,
        145.73638916015625,
        323.375244140625
      ],
      "text": "information:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        332.3346252441406,
        282.8003845214844,
        345.8011169433594
      ],
      "text": "what the family knows about TB; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        351.8039245605469,
        463.0054626464844,
        365.2704162597656
      ],
      "text": "whether the family has acknowledged that the child has TB (and HIV); -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        371.2732238769531,
        421.2490234375,
        384.7397155761719
      ],
      "text": "the parents’ state of health and their psychological condition; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        390.7425231933594,
        472.3664855957031,
        404.2090148925781
      ],
      "text": "whether the parents are capable of providing physical care for the child; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        410.2118225097656,
        508.37298583984375,
        423.6783142089844
      ],
      "text": "the individuals who can offer support to the family, their age and health status; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        429.6811218261719,
        509.86798095703125,
        443.1476135253906
      ],
      "text": "whether the individuals identified are willing and able to help care for the child; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        449.75042724609375,
        415.2113952636719,
        463.2169189453125
      ],
      "text": "the social services available to the family in their community. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        471.4164123535156,
        449.2400207519531,
        484.7679138183594
      ],
      "text": "In practical terms, support for a family with a child with TB should include:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        495.9236145019531,
        513.383056640625,
        509.2751159667969
      ],
      "text": "Psychological support to family members receiving test results showing that their",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        499.59552001953125,
        91.36740112304688,
        507.59552001953125
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        511.92010498046875,
        513.4176635742188,
        525.2716064453125
      ],
      "text": "child has TB disease. This must allow time for the family to ask any questions they",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        527.9165649414062,
        343.458984375,
        541.26806640625
      ],
      "text": "may have regarding diagnosis and management.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        549.9236450195312,
        513.463623046875,
        563.275146484375
      ],
      "text": "Support in assisting the family to understand their child’s TB through appropriate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        553.5955200195312,
        91.36740112304688,
        561.5955200195312
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        565.9201049804688,
        448.4310607910156,
        579.2716064453125
      ],
      "text": "information and educational materials about the treatment, including:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        585.7236328125,
        381.6169128417969,
        599.1901245117188
      ],
      "text": "the actual treatment for TB that the child will receive; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        605.5236206054688,
        322.8748779296875,
        618.9901123046875
      ],
      "text": "the frequency and duration of treatment; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        625.3236083984375,
        433.389892578125,
        638.7901000976562
      ],
      "text": "the health services that are available for TB (and HIV) treatment; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        645.1235961914062,
        425.75396728515625,
        658.590087890625
      ],
      "text": "what is required from the family in relation to continuing care; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        664.9236450195312,
        328.4179382324219,
        678.39013671875
      ],
      "text": "planning a schedule of clinical monitoring; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        684.7236328125,
        331.8104248046875,
        698.1901245117188
      ],
      "text": "simple infection control measures at home; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        705.1235961914062,
        244.07688903808594,
        718.590087890625
      ],
      "text": "plans to return to school. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        727.1235961914062,
        510.23199462890625,
        740.47509765625
      ],
      "text": "Support to help address issues for older children and adolescents with TB and TB/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        730.7954711914062,
        91.36740112304688,
        738.7954711914062
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        743.1201171875,
        123.84349822998047,
        756.4716186523438
      ],
      "text": "HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        765.1235961914062,
        513.4866333007812,
        778.47509765625
      ],
      "text": "Referral for screening for TB of other family members, especially siblings, and other",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        768.7954711914062,
        91.36740112304688,
        776.7954711914062
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        781.1201171875,
        176.43299865722656,
        794.4716186523438
      ],
      "text": "close contacts.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "84",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}